# Hong Kong Bank — personal Quantumult X draft
# Updated: 2026-09-18 | Policy: Bank
# Scope: HSBC HK / EleBank / ZA / Wise; not all Hong Kong banks.
# Create/select policy Bank before import. No claim of complete App coverage.
# Sources and optional dependencies: see README.md.

# HSBC HK and shared HSBC services
HOST-SUFFIX,hsbc.com.hk,Bank
HOST-SUFFIX,hsbc.com,Bank
HOST-SUFFIX,hsbc,Bank
HOST-SUFFIX,hsbc.net,Bank
HOST-SUFFIX,hsbcnet.com,Bank
# PayMe / vv1865: community-maintained HSBC domain inventory
HOST-SUFFIX,vv1865.com,Bank

# EleBank
HOST-SUFFIX,elebank.com,Bank

# ZA: inherited from upstream Bank.list; App coverage unverified
HOST-SUFFIX,za.group,Bank
HOST-SUFFIX,zainvest.group,Bank
HOST-SUFFIX,zajourney.com,Bank

# Wise: included for personal use alongside HK banks
HOST-SUFFIX,wise.com,Bank
# Official Wise documentation also lists this production API endpoint
HOST,api.transferwise.com,Bank

# Optional HSBC-specific third-party hosts from upstream; enable after testing
# HOST,c-hsbc.lytics.io,Bank
# HOST,hsbc.edge.sdk.awswaf.com,Bank
# HOST,log-58144bf0.we-stats.com,Bank

# Optional SHARED third-party services from upstream (disabled by default).
